          Who We Are
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-lg md:text-[1.45rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <p>
            Town Crier Evangelical Ministries is a vibrant, Spirit-filled ministry dedicated to fulfilling the Great Commission.
            We are a community of believers passionate about worship, biblical teaching, evangelism, and discipleship.
          </p>

          <p>
            Founded on the unchanging truth of God's Word, we exist to glorify God, make disciples, and impact our world with the
            transforming message of Jesus Christ. Our ministry is characterized by authentic worship, sound doctrine, genuine fellowship,
            and compassionate service.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

